{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JOo0SF7Q0V1795498129.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受東北季候風影響，未來一兩日早晚清涼。</p><p></p><p>天文台指，早上多處地區氣溫較昨日低三至四度。預測大致多雲，下午短暫時間有陽光，今晚天氣稍涼。預計明日及星期四早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16、17度左右。本周後期天漸轉天晴乾燥，氣溫回升。</p><p></p><p>另外，受天文大潮及東北季候風的共同影響，預料本港明晚沿岸水位較正常稍高，部分低窪地區可能出現輕微水浸。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.159284+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T20:37:33.493782+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:33.532379+00:00","content_hash":"3d3cc36c2193c1c0137a4d481b4b634dd9aa51ff997ffe9c5e18ffaf0a4208e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.159284+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}